{"id": "p-2026090315-mfxj", "post_id": "18068106569739074", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T06:00:57.759148+00:00", "date": "2026-09-04", "hour": 15, "text_len": 116, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "ホームページ制作で、いちばん止まりやすいのは写真です。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc2sYtAET2f", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 13, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090317-wviq", "post_id": "17986944545859102", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T08:01:06.100346+00:00", "date": "2026-09-04", "hour": 17, "text_len": 101, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "シンプルなお菓子ほど、コーヒーの味が出る。そんな組み合わせの記事です。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc26IQnlUiL", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 173, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090319-jear", "post_id": "18157593937500457", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T10:01:01.898562+00:00", "date": "2026-09-04", "hour": 19, "text_len": 114, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "福井で仕事をしていると、紹介の連鎖に驚くことがあります。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc3H27pFS-4", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 687, "likes": 4, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 5, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090321-a7mn", "post_id": "18133485436725360", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T12:01:05.253162+00:00", "date": "2026-09-04", "hour": 21, "text_len": 84, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "コーヒーに合わせるために作られた羊羹があるそうです。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc3VmQ8HBXS", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 174, "likes": 1, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 2, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090323-aovd", "post_id": "18176330203432863", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T14:01:08.087096+00:00", "date": "2026-09-04", "hour": 23, "text_len": 111, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "「広告はどれをやればいいですか」と聞かれることがあります。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc3jVBgINKF", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 27, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090406-wr1p", "post_id": "17962044734983059", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T21:01:05.951653+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 6, "text_len": 83, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "なんでもない朝に作る、うちのお弁当。", "opening": "短い断言", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc4TZLmgY5u", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 117, "likes": 2, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 3, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090408-4vd3", "post_id": "18103853885209353", "posted_at": "2026-09-04T23:01:02.542886+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 8, "text_len": 77, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "「うちには、特に強みなんてないんです」", "opening": "短い断言", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc4hH1mm5Hi", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 74, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "短（〜80字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090410-3zq9", "post_id": "18091710041424694", "posted_at": "2026-09-05T01:01:00.743640+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 10, "text_len": 90, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "喫茶店の味を、家で再現するという発想です。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc4u2jvm8Kg", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 199, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
