{"id": "p-2026090415-vtca", "post_id": "18160421119490453", "posted_at": "2026-09-05T06:01:05.514625+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 15, "text_len": 88, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "ホームページ制作でいちばん聞き忘れやすいのは、公開したあとの話です。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc5RL4eleNA", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 174, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090417-70xi", "post_id": "17947021782054500", "posted_at": "2026-09-05T08:01:02.463480+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 17, "text_len": 94, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "インスタントコーヒーの前提が、少し変わりそうな記事です。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc5e655m-o8", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 61, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090419-1q20", "post_id": "17930138247146423", "posted_at": "2026-09-05T10:01:00.734004+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 19, "text_len": 78, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "ホテルの発信をお手伝いするとき、悩むのは「何を出さないか」でした。", "opening": "説明文", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc5sptilrBS", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 37, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "短（〜80字）"}
{"id": "p-2026090421-bfio", "post_id": "18101058548578289", "posted_at": "2026-09-05T12:01:06.703352+00:00", "date": "2026-09-05", "hour": 21, "text_len": 99, "has_thread": true, "first_line": "焙煎する前の豆を、使うという発想です。", "opening": "短い断言", "note": "", "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@urala._.fukui/post/Dc56ZBfoIer", "measured_at": "2026-09-07T17:53:48.108580+09:00", "views": 112, "likes": 0, "replies": 1, "reposts": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "eng": 1, "length_bucket": "中（81〜150字）"}
